# Private Claude Code notes — example only

Copy to CLAUDE.local.md only if needed and exclude it from Git. Keep the project's
CLAUDE.md bridge to shared AGENTS.md so private notes do not hide shared policy.

- Prefer the browser/MCP integration already configured for this user after
  checking it is available. Do not require teammates to install it.
- Use local/user harness settings for personal hooks and model/account choices.
- Keep shared operating facts in AGENTS.local.md when both harnesses need them;
  do not duplicate a private runbook into multiple instruction files.

These notes supplement the shared project rules and grant no extra permissions.
